# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SETHU-CARE backend — environment configuration (reference)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values:   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored and loaded automatically on startup (see cmd/api/main.go) —
# for LOCAL DEV ONLY. In production, inject these as real environment variables via
# your platform's secrets manager; do NOT ship a .env file. Real environment
# variables always take precedence over .env (godotenv never overrides them).
#
# Every value below has a safe default in internal/config/config.go EXCEPT the
# ones marked «SECRET», which you must supply. Lines marked «DEV ONLY» must be
# unset/false in production.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Address the API listens on. Locally use :8090 (:8080 is often taken by another app).
ADDR=:8090

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL + PostGIS DSN. Default targets the local docker-compose database.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://sethu:sethu@127.0.0.1:5434/sethu?sslmode=disable

# ── Auth (JWT) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# «SECRET» Signing key for session tokens. REQUIRED in production — set a long random
# value. If left blank the server uses an insecure built-in dev secret and logs a warning.
JWT_SECRET=
# Token lifetime as a Go duration (e.g. 24h, 168h).
JWT_TTL=24h

# ── Dev login helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# «DEV ONLY» When true, POST /auth/otp returns the OTP in its response and logs it,
# so you can sign in without an SMS provider. MUST be false/unset in production.
SETHU_DEV_OTP=true
# App Store review bypass: this one reserved phone accepts the fixed code below (no SMS,
# no rate limit). Leave blank to disable. The number must already exist in the DB with the
# role under review (a technician for the provider app, an admin for the console, etc.).
# «DEV ONLY» For the admin console's dev login (ops@setucare.in / password123, seeded by
# db/seed.sql), set SETHU_DEMO_PHONE=+919000000008 and SETHU_DEMO_OTP=123456 so the
# two-factor step accepts the static demo code.
SETHU_DEMO_PHONE=
SETHU_DEMO_OTP=

# Deployment name served by GET /admin/version: development | staging | production.
APP_ENV=development

# ── UPI collection ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The company VPA and payee name encoded into the customer-facing UPI QR / intent.
SETHU_UPI_VPA=sethucare@upi
SETHU_UPI_PAYEE=SETHU-CARE

# ── Cloudinary — technician work photos ──────────────────────────────────────
# «SECRET» Direct signed uploads for before/after job photos. Until ALL THREE are set,
# the photo endpoints return 503 and the provider app shows "Photo uploads aren't set up yet".
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# ── MSG91 — OTP SMS delivery ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# «SECRET» Delivers login and job start/completion codes via MSG91's Flow API using a
# DLT-approved OTP template (India/TRAI requires an approved template + registered sender).
# The template must declare a single variable named `otp`. When AUTH_KEY and TEMPLATE_ID are
# set, real SMS is sent; otherwise codes are only logged (SETHU_DEV_OTP still echoes them).
MSG91_AUTH_KEY=
MSG91_SENDER_ID=SETHUC
MSG91_OTP_TEMPLATE_ID=

# ── Razorpay — payment collection ────────────────────────────────────────────
# «SECRET» When KEY_ID + KEY_SECRET are set, a completed UPI/ONLINE booking is collected via a
# hosted Razorpay payment link (the customer opens it), and a Razorpay webhook captures the
# payment (POST /webhooks/razorpay, authenticated by the webhook signature). Without these, the
# customer gets a upi:// intent and an admin captures by hand. Set the webhook secret to the value
# you configure in the Razorpay dashboard webhook for the payment_link.paid event.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ── Business rules ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credit issued to a customer when a booking fails, in paise (10000 = ₹100).
SETHU_FAILED_CREDIT_PAISE=10000
